s by the biochemical assay  and 98  of tumors that failed to stain lacked the receptors  Added by  Frederick Carl Koerner  M D  Signed On  04 REMOVED_MONTH 96 at 14 11 GROSS DESCRIPTION  Received fresh in the Frozen Section Lab   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name and unit number and  right breast lump is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 2 0cm piece of fibrofatty breast tissue  The external surface is inked in black and the specimen is sectioned to reveal an ill defined mass REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 2 0cm closely present 0 4cm from the nearest inked margin  Cut surface of the mass is soft  somewhat gelatinous  multi cystic and hemorrhagic  A representative section is frozen as FX 1  now in cassette A  Representative sections in B F  Gross Description by  JANINE L  DUDAC Resident  RHONDA YANTISS  MD     INTRA OPERATIVE DIAGNOSIS     FROZEN SECTION DIAGNOSIS  1  BREAST  RIGHT   EXCISIONAL BIOPSY  INFILTRATING CARCINOMA  O R  Resident  Navneet Narula  MD O R  Diagnosis by  Jacqueline Haas  MD O R  Staff Pathologist  Suzanne B  Keel  M D                                                                                  SOURCE CARE UNIT  SAME DAY SURGICAL UNIT    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  REPORTS TO  Frederick William Ackroyd  M D  RHONDA YANTISS  M D  Jacqueline Joan Haas  M D  PART   BREAST  RIGHT   BIOPSY , Unchecked.
