esection margin  C  Biopsy site with skin ellipse  D  A representative section of the biopsy site  E F  Representative section of nodular area from lower outer quadrant  G  Representative sections of uninvolved parenchyma  medial   H  Representative sections of uninvolved parenchyma  lateral   I L  Node from axillary tail  Resident  QUN DONG  MD                                                                                 SOURCE CARE UNIT  MGH INPATIENT  FLR UNKNOWN  REPORTS TO  David L Berger  M D  PART   BREAST  LEFT MODIFIED RADICAL   MASTECTOMY   report_end  , Unchecked.
