m the superior  1 2cm from the anterior  1 5cm from the superior and 2 2cm from the interior margins  The borders of the cavity are diffusely hemorrhagic  rubbery and fibrotic  with focal tan yellow chalky areas  The remaining uninvolved parenchyma consists of tan yellow to pink lobulated unremarkable fibrotic tissue  Representative sections were submitted as follows  A  Cavity wall to closest posterior margin B C  Cavity wall to closest medial margin D  Representative sections of cavity wall  E F  Uninvolved parenchyma with the posterior smooth fibrotic area in cassette E  Received fresh   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name and unit number  and  final shaved margins  medial   are REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 5cm of irregular tan yellow to pink unoriented portions of fibrofatty tissue  This specimen is serially sectioned to reveal a tan yellow unremarkable cut surface with focally rubbery fibrotic areas  The specimen is entirely submitted in cassettes G through P  Received fresh   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name and unit number   final shaved margins  lateral half of cavity   are REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 0cm of unoriented  irregular tan yellow to pink fibrofatty tissue  The specimen is sectioned to reveal an unremarkable tan yellow to pink cut surface  The specimen is entirely submitted in cassettes Q X  Gross Description by  JENNIFER NASH Resident  LYNN CORNELL  MD                                                                                 SOURCE CARE UNIT  SAME DAY SURGICAL UNIT    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  REPORTS TO  Barbara Lynn Smith  M D  PART A  BREAST  LEFT   EXCISIONAL BIOPSY PART B  BREAST  LEFT MEDIAL  FINAL SHAVED MARGIN   EXCISIO PART C  BREAST  LEFT LATERAL  FINAL SHAVED MARGIN   EXCISI , Unchecked.
